                "Caustic cracker CK-2 at Monazite-Rill MR-4 is already at 0.85 rph with off-gas HF "
                "1.2 ppm against a 5.0 ppm cap. Shell leftover is 318 C under a 360 C cap. HF-first "
                "accepts the 0.85 rph; IR-first would have rejected a legal digest on a "
